{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const MAC_MODIFIER_LABELS: Record<CanonicalModifier | \"Mod\", string>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/display-labels.ts#L45","children":[{"type":"text","value":"display-labels.ts:45"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Modifier key labels for macOS display."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Used by formatting functions to display hotkeys with macOS-style text labels\n(e.g., 'Control' for Control, 'Option' for Alt, 'Cmd' for Meta) instead of symbols.\nThis provides a familiar macOS look and feel in hotkey displays."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"MAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Control'] // 'control'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Alt'] // 'option'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Shift'] // 'shift'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Meta'] // 'cmd'","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nconst MAC_MODIFIER_LABELS: Record<CanonicalModifier | \"Mod\", string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [display-labels.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/display-labels.ts#L45)\n\nModifier key labels for macOS display.\n\nUsed by formatting functions to display hotkeys with macOS-style text labels\n(e.g., 'Control' for Control, 'Option' for Alt, 'Cmd' for Meta) instead of symbols.\nThis provides a familiar macOS look and feel in hotkey displays.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Control'] // 'control'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Alt'] // 'option'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Shift'] // 'shift'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Meta'] // 'cmd'\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MAC_MODIFIER_LABELS\ntitle: MAC_MODIFIER_LABELS\n---\n\n```ts\nconst MAC_MODIFIER_LABELS: Record<CanonicalModifier | \"Mod\", string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [display-labels.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/display-labels.ts#L45)\n\nModifier key labels for macOS display.\n\nUsed by formatting functions to display hotkeys with macOS-style text labels\n(e.g., 'Control' for Control, 'Option' for Alt, 'Cmd' for Meta) instead of symbols.\nThis provides a familiar macOS look and feel in hotkey displays.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Control'] // 'control'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Alt'] // 'option'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Shift'] // 'shift'\nMAC_MODIFIER_LABELS['Meta'] // 'cmd'\n```\n"}
